<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰρ-ιστήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for
				thanksgiving,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.88
				</span></i>
			: so in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				10.17
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.566.19
			</span></i> (Aezani, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.236
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμοιβαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕμνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					4.158a
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία χ. ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαριστήριον, τό,</span>
			<i>thank-offering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.3003
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				4798
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.3100
			</span></i> (Lebad.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.672a
			</span></i>, etc.: freq. in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαριστήρια, τά,</span>
			<i>thank-offerings,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τοῖς θεοῖς ἀποτελεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.1.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφειλήσειν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.2.28
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφέρειν, θῦσαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.76
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύειν τοῖς θεοῖς χ. τῶν εὐτυχημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					21.2.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. τροφῶν ἀποδιδόναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Patr.Enc.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ Ἑκάτῃ χ. τῆς νίκης ἑορτάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.862a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἐλευθερίας,</span> in memory
			of the liberation by Thrasybulus on <i><span class="en">
				12t
			</span></i>h Boëdromion, ib.<i><span class="en">
				349f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Neanth.
				9J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				654.8
			</span></i> (Egypt. <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>); = Lat.
				<i>supplicatio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
